Welcome to Thy News.
We have made it for you. Today’s world is full of free and available information so it’s difficult to really find what you are looking for. There is too much spam. You can’t afford to waste so much time, can you?
Searching for convenience, we developed a perfect solution for those who only want to receive updates on what they are subscribed for. Check out news on politics, science, technologies, sports, etc.
The greatest feature is your ability to manage your sources. You can edit them, create your own feeds, share with social networks and even read offline.
Main points:
- 149,000 sources around the world;
- add your own sources additionally;
- a perfect solution for those who only want to receive updates on sources they are subscribed for;
- create your own feeds, edit them, integrate with social networks and manage your feeds from the main menu;
- share your news with others and save them for further reading in offline mode;
- check out news on politics, science, technologies, sports, games or what only you want.
Create your own news feeds with Thy News!
Enjoy!
